msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぷぷ…やったね、大正解だよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Good job. You got it right!"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハ！
#. 見事に大正解だよーッ！！
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahahaha! Brilliantly right!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>正解…？
